ue so super  super easy super cool this number  sections is the in the table of contents  on the side you could see how those  sections are numbered and the cool thing  about that adding that thing is that  when you run an ad section to take away  sections the numbers will automatically  update which is which is just nice  dynamic table displays are really easy  if you just put this DF print equals  page command at the top and every every  table that you print you don't have to  even use like the knitter cable any of  that stuff it'll just come out in this  nice nice format that's cool and then  finally the document theme you can put  all these different themes I like using  the Bhoots watch themes there's so many  of them I don't know if you ever gone  here but there's a lot of really cool  themes here and I like to go in and and  you just put the name of the theme  inside of your markdown and then you can  you have your theme and that's that's  cool and I learned a lot of this from  our markdown the definitive guide which  was by Evie she and JJ Alera and Garrett  from almond and it was I it was so easy  to learn just by like reading this so I  highly encourage you to go look at it if  it's something that you if are more kind  of something that's like scary and you  haven't tried yet great resource and  then also boots watch themes are cool to  play with so when you're creating your  arm rectum so there's there's all the  formatting you can make that nice you  can do all of the writing inside of it  and then you can also create your code  so that's where this is really powerful  in creating a code chunk is super easy  you define them by these three back  ticks and if you are going to do it at  are you can put are if you're gonna do  Python which I learned yesterday  apparently you can make a Python and  then do Python inside  which is really cool I when I'm creating  markdowns  I like to put all my libraries and I'm  gonna use the analysis all inside of the  setup